  abilityName: Possess
  abilityDescription: 'Base ability

    Lyra seizes control of a nearby enemy, turning
    it against its allies.

    The possessed enemy''s real soul awakens and fights
    for the twins until the effect expires.

    Damage dealt by the possessed enemy
    scales with Lyra''s multiplier.'
  baseTargetCount: 1
  baseDuration: 3
  baseCooldown: 7.5
  baseRange: 5
  baseRegenRate: 16.6
